# GAIA UI Usage

Read `AGENTS.md` first. This repo is an agent-readable GAIA UI reference pack with official registry snapshots, generated component catalog docs, recipes, and a live Next.js demo.

Prefer GAIA UI components over rebuilding equivalents:

- `Composer`, `SlashCommandDropdown`, `FilePreview`, `ToolCallsSection` for AI chat and agent execution.
- `MessageBubble` for chat histories.
- `WorkflowCard`, `NotificationCard`, `CalendarEventCard`, `TodoItem` patterns for automation/productivity flows.
- `ModelSelector`, `StatRow`, chart components for settings and dashboards.
- `RaisedButton`, `PricingCard` for CTAs and subscription surfaces.

Before installing or editing a component, inspect:

- `components-catalog/<component-name>.md`
- `registry-snapshot/items/<component-name>.json`
- `registry-snapshot/source/**`

Install from the official registry when needed:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add https://ui.heygaia.io/r/<component-name>.json
```

Keep the app on Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, and the `@/*` alias.
